#: digikam/albumiconviewfilter.cpp:76
msgid ""
"This LED indicates the global image filter status, encompassing all status-bar filters and all tag filters from the right sidebar.\n"
"\n"
"GRAY: no filter is active, all items are visible.\n"
"RED: filtering is on, but no items match.\n"
"GREEN: filter(s) match(es) at least one item.\n"
"\n"
"Any mouse button click will reset all filters."
msgstr ""
"Disse Latücht wiest den globalen Bildfilter-Status, de all Statusbalken-Filtern un all Betekerfiltern ut dat rechte Sietpaneel ümfaat.\n"
"\n"
"Gries: Keen Filter is an, all Stücken sünd sichtbor.\n"
"Root: Filtert warrt, man keen Stück passt.\n"
"Gröön: De Filter(n) passt op tominnst een Stück.\n"
"\n"
"Mit en Muusklick kannst Du de Filtern torüchsetten."

