#~ "<p>Note: to simulate an <b>Ilford SFX200</b> infrared film, use a sensitivity excursion of 200 to 800. A sensitivity over 800 simulates <b>Kodak HIE</b> high-speed infrared film. This last one creates a more dramatic photographic style.</p>"
